On available
    Say "Why did [Order of the Sorcery] start the [Devil War] anyways? He probably would not answer us, right? Anyways, let's go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hmm ...there's a strange movement in the underworld. We need to speed up our progress."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This time...Hmm ... You need to go to the underworld. The devil this time is [23Devil] Aim, the duke of destruction. With him are [47Devil] Uvall and [66Devil] Cimejes. They are all very powerful. Be careful.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [23Devil] Aim, [47Devil] Uvall, and [66Devil] Cimejes."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hmm ...there's a strange movement in the underworld. We need to speed up our progress."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This time...Hmm ... You need to go to the underworld. The devil this time is [23Devil] Aim, the duke of destruction. With him are [47Devil] Uvall and [66Devil] Cimejes. They are all very powerful. Be careful.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [23Devil] Aim, [47Devil] Uvall, and [66Devil] Cimejes."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "We should stop the devils' movement. This time, you have to destroy [Devil 11] Duke Gusion. He's one of the strongest devils who rules over 40 legions of demons. We have to destroy him in order to stop their movement. Go to the [Luferson Castle] with the [Devil 11 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and summon the [Devil 11] Gusion from the [Devil 11 Summoning Stone] and destroy him. [Devil 11 Summoning Stone] may be placed somewhere in the [Luferson Castle]. I'll wait to hear the good news from you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We should stop the devils' movement. This time, you have to destroy [Devil 11] Duke Gusion. He's one of the strongest devils who rules over 40 legions of demons. We have to destroy him in order to stop their movement. Go to the [El Morad Castle] with the [Devil 11 Summoning Scroll] that I gave you, and summon the [Devil 11] Gusion from the [Devil 11 Summoning Stone] and destroy him. [Devil 11 Summoning Stone] may be placed somewhere in the [El Morad Castle]. I'll wait to hear the good news from you."
